# License information

This repository contains components under different licenses. The following
SPDX expression summarizes those components; it does not relicense every file
under all three licenses:

    BSD-3-Clause AND Apache-2.0 AND OFL-1.1

- GigaDevice-generated code carrying the original three-clause BSD notice
  remains under BSD-3-Clause. See LICENSES/BSD-3-Clause.txt and the file headers.
- port/aic_ui.h carries the RT-Thread Apache-2.0 notice. See
  LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.
- The converted Noto Sans CJK SC and Font Awesome font data in
  generated/font/font_notosanscjksc_regular_14_b49ae336.c is under SIL OFL 1.1.
  See LICENSES/OFL-1.1.txt and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for copyright, provenance
  and redistribution information. The separate fallback wrapper retains its
  original GigaDevice code license.

Preserve the applicable copyright notices and license texts when redistributing
these components, including their converted font data. Include the font notices
and OFL text with distributions of the package and with products containing it.

The font license permits commercial use and bundling with proprietary software;
it does not require the surrounding application to be open source. Font data
and modified versions remain subject to OFL 1.1 and may not be sold by themselves.

External LVGL, simulator dependencies and newly added assets retain their own
licenses. The generated project's code license does not replace asset licenses.
